{"server":"cn","storyId":"act20side_level_act20side_01_end","groupId":"act20side","stageId":"act20side_01","title":"沉浸式游览","storyCode":"IC-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"580272a22f115235320bac3512d803aef338f5584870fb5ddd43ee92273c672c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g1_durinstreet"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"别害羞，特米米，很适合你嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真......真的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，这件泳衣我一眼就看中了，是我喜欢的风格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"这家店的裁缝可真了不起，居然这么快就能改出适合你身材的款式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我的身材有什么问题吗？最近我有加大训练运动量的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，很可爱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，那就好，我可不想再被笑话尾巴又粗了......依娜姆不去挑挑看泳衣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算了。我倒是对刚才那个帮裁缝打下手的金属脑袋更感兴趣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"杜林的技术吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是太高超了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我从没喝过如此醇美的酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，兄弟，祝你健康！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"祝我们健康，干杯！老卡尔蜜酿万岁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"喂特米米，这个叫极境的......真的靠得住吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，极境先生关键时候还是很厉害的，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，罗德岛上也有杜林族干员，但他们从来不说自己城市的事情呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"难道杜林族有什么隐藏的秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我觉得他们只是不太在意，他们大概更关心中午食堂吃什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"真没想到，我们居然有机会来到建在地下的杜林城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这或许是让嘉维尔的名字在杜林人里也传播开的大好机会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你这次休假，居然没拉着嘉维尔、祖玛玛和克玛尔一起回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克玛尔说她想和煌小姐一起练拳。嘉维尔和祖玛玛去出任务了还没回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔最近实在是太累了，让人操心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真希望她能不要这么勉强自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走之前给她们留了信，把你们发现斯第奇先生的事，还有斯第奇先生说的话都写下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是她们能借着这个机会回阿卡胡拉休息一下就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那两个家伙，还有你，当初二话不说就让我当了这里的大酋长，也该回来看看我勉为其难了这么久的成果吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"说句题外话，你们平时在罗德岛的时候有没有觉得，这个叫极境的，有点烦人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦哦，完全不同的风味！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大醉的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高个子，我看你刚才和那帮喜欢蜜酿的家伙混在一起，听我一句，那就是儿童饮料！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大醉的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的好东西还得看咱们七号烈酒，来，干杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"干杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"这香气，是暴雨过后的雨林，地下溶洞中苔藓的味道......!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大醉的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊抱歉，是木头杯子有点发霉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来他倒的确乐在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，依娜姆，你还没和我说过，在哪遇到斯第奇先生的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......这就说来话长了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"大酋长，你上次带来的大家伙可真带劲儿！对着那些东西，我已经通了好几个宵啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天我老婆天天念叨我，说我的魂都快被这些东西勾走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是几台哥伦比亚的报废车床吗，不至于吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"那可太至于了！传说中的制造机器的机器！你体会过那东西在你面前运转起来的感觉吗？我和我老婆恋爱的时候，心都没跳得这么快过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，改天我让人给你的车床装个减震。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米再过些日子要回来了，得早做准备，去接她一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再兴奋的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"接特米米？我已经能想象出那得是多繁重的体力劳动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唉声叹气的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"约等于被车床揍了一顿的劳累吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再兴奋的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"天知道她又会带多少收藏品回来！上次她寄回来的包裹，我们去了几个人搬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再兴奋的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"我一开始还以为那是一整支商队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唉声叹气的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米她从小就是这样没错啦，总喜欢收集一些乱七八糟的东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唉声叹气的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，她去罗德岛的这几年，是不是有点变本加厉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再兴奋的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"我是搞不懂为什么她要把嘉维尔打穿的钢板寄回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唉声叹气的阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"听说是因为在罗德岛的宿舍放不下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，前面是不是有人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定是疯了才上来找罪受。先是那一串七拐八绕的洞窟，然后又是这么一片鬼地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可地心那老家伙也实在是太烦了，每天就是堵着门唠唠叨叨......啧，这些讨厌的藤蔓！这该死的太阳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然人造光源要比这玩意好得多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好渴，困了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全无法理解老师为什么要离开际崖城，找不痛快吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是小孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好奇怪的口音，谁教你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩子？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自学的，不满意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩子要有礼貌，和别人说话不许这么不耐烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"这人长得好奇怪，阿卡胡拉还有这样的人？是谁家走失的孩子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不是粗尾巴，也不是细尾巴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是黎博利或者斐迪亚，不，等等，难道你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你是杜林人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"杜林？杜林人是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只在杂志上看到过，据说是一种生活在地下的奇怪种族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是磐蟹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"也许是磐蟹？","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是磐蟹呢！找揍吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！我想起来了！前几年的《奇谈怪论》上写过，据说杜林人的酿酒水平很高，这一点和磐蟹不太一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"磐蟹最多也就吃点发酵的水果把自己搞醉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"而且磐蟹也不是生活在地下，它们只是会用土把自己埋起来而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不是磐蟹","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重点不是在那里吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不是磐蟹","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，果然，地上人就是一群目光短浅的自大狂，什么都不懂还喜欢到处发表议论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不是磐蟹","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"简直比杜林人还蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不是磐蟹","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，最重要的是，审美也糟得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小杜林，我穿的可是萨尔贡最流行的款式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小杜林","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"选择所谓的“流行款式”就足够证明你审美的糟糕程度了。被别人塑造的审美有什么价值？可悲的附庸罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大酋长，这小子是不是有点欠修理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟年纪还小，算了算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小杜林","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就成年了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成年的小杜林","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我和这些傻子啰嗦什么，告辞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那个小孩子走掉了哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？又停住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成年的小杜林","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成年的小杜林","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，我说，如果不太介意的话，地上人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成年的小杜林","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能给口水喝吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g1_durinstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，后来就是你在发给我的信里写的那样，他说杜林人的城市遇到了一点小麻烦，需要我们的帮忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"起码当时这位斯第奇是这么声称的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"看看我们的周围！这漂亮的城市，哪有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝儿！哪有一点有麻烦的样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，酒太好喝或许也是麻烦，容易把人喝趴下，不过我倒是没醉，干杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"这个别扭的小鬼大概只是想邀请我们参观一下他那些漂亮的房子吧，完全可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"别把谁都想得和你一样，极境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇在我们这里住了一个月，有一天看见了那些正在折腾造火车的阿达克利斯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"然后他说，呃，“够专业！你们焊的这些破铜烂铁能帮上我的大忙！要不要来际崖城看看？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"你就——兄弟，麻烦添满，剩下的这点我先干了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么答应了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然斯第奇极力渲染了一场危机......其实我主要还是为了满足一下自己的好奇心，顺便看看和我们地下的邻居有没有生意可做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好功利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉要想摆脱野蛮的状态，现在可是什么都缺啊。听说杜林族的冶炼和制造技术都很厉害，要是能帮他们这个忙，换上一两样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也不用再为搞到了点报废品就兴奋半天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆......你居然真的在好好当大酋长啊！我还以为你会天天去城里买东西，然后把钱都花光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子，平日里就是这么看我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉想要发展，最重要的当然是钱，萨尔贡金币也好，哥伦比亚金券也好，维多利亚镑也好，我们全都需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"但是就凭借现在阿卡胡拉的产出——一些粗陋的手工制品，一些未精炼的矿石，别说赚钱了，连让大家过上好日子都勉勉强强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，好在你们也不在乎城市里定义的那种“好日子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，钱和财富是有区别的，一味地积攒钱财什么都带不来，真正流动起来的才能被称作“财富”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉正在变好，而要变得更好，还需要一个契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说，和杜林人的技术合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，开始听不懂了......反正对我来说，遇到困难就用法术！法术不行就用法杖敲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我们“嘉维尔意志”的生活方式！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，你怎么在罗德岛待了这么久，还是这一套？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，唉，我能做到的也就是这些细枝末节的事情了，想让阿卡胡拉发展起来，还需要一个，“领袖”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，依娜姆你不就是大酋长吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"领袖是能把你们提亚卡乌真正团结在一起的家伙。我？我可嫌麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我宁愿去城里逛街。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"很好的设想！我也喜欢逛街，不过更喜欢野外，嗝儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，是不是有个吵吵闹闹的小个子消失好久了？藏到哪里去玩了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是哎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是去做准备了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不过，既然大滑梯就在眼前......先放松一下也没什么问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我听罗德岛上的炎国干员说过一个词！叫......叫什么“客随主便”......来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概的意思就是，既然主人不在，客人就可以随便了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝儿！说得好！为了这句话我得再喝一杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友们，我们来比比谁先到大滑梯脚下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......极境先生，适应杜林人生活的速度，还真是快呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g10_lakegarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼，终于摆脱那帮醉鬼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说我讨厌这些没心没肺的杜林人！这些家伙都把宝贵的生命浪费在了什么上面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才走了一个月，际崖城真是又丑了不少。唉！我就不该回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那几个傻乎乎的地上人呢？啧，只要他们能修出不至于塌掉的铁路桥，我的标准也不是不能放低一点......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇？你真的回来了！我听说有个不会喝酒的杜林在际崖城里乱跑，就猜到是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶奇·地心......你还真是阴魂不散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这段时间到底跑到哪里去了？我到处找你，就快拼着老命去塌方的山洞那里看看了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这条老命可硬得很，倒是我，差点就死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道......你去了地上？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，不可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇，我真是没想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你好大的胆子，你居然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然这么有出息！快，让我看看你带回来了什么稀奇玩意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"升降梯上面那串山洞太难走了，地图又不知道放去哪里了，好些年没人愿意上去玩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总给我带了点礼物吧！远方的矿石标本？地上特有的酿酒植物？难道是最新的《奇谈怪论》？！图书馆里的那一批都过期好久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，呃，怎么说呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我带了几个人回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“于是，她选择了......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“她选择了老卡尔蜜酿！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不太好，是不是产品进入得太慢了？得稍微改一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“比划算更划算，比疯狂还疯狂！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果你想找到一片让人尽情享受的土地，一段可以肆意玩乐的时间，当然，还有一口安抚灵魂的蜜酒——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“认准际崖城的老卡尔蜜酿！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的鲁珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，简洁明快，直白大方，委托人应该会喜欢的，但愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["极境"]}]}
